<p>Files in <code>js/</code> and <code>css/</code> are prefixed with their folder, templates use their plain file name so <code>uebertool_twig_loader</code> can find them by template name. A script and a stylesheet with the same name end up in the same library.</p>

<p><code>js__main</code>, <code>css__tailwind</code> and <code>css__gin-custom</code> are loaded on every page through the <a href="{{ path('uebertool_docs_pages.page', { slug: 'theme-info' }) }}">dist theme</a>.</p>

<h2>Detected Drupal dependencies</h2>
<p>The plugin scans each script for Drupal APIs and adds the matching core libraries as dependencies:</p>
